<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Unipetrol half-yr profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Unipetrol half-yr profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result for Unipetrol to end-June 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover		    5,500   vs 4,900</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    485.5 vs   463</p>
<p>Taxation			145.7 vs   163.1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     339.9 vs   301</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
